# text = On the very last day of the regiment's remaining at Meryton , he dined , with other of the officers , at Longbourn ; and so little was Elizabeth disposed to part from him in good humour , that on his making some inquiry as to the manner in which her time had passed at Hunsford , she mentioned Colonel Fitzwilliam's and Mr . Darcy's having both spent three weeks at Rosings , and asked him , if he was acquainted with the former .
